#: luci-app-xvpn/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/xvpn/split.js:124
msgid ""
"xray finds the domain of a connection by sniffing (Settings tab, on by "
"default) and sends these domains out directly. Such traffic still passes "
"xray, but without encryption. Keep the list short: tens or hundreds of "
"domains. The router resolves them with its own DNS (the provider's), the "
"clients' DNS still goes through the tunnel."
msgstr ""

